 "variants": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Starting next month the neighborhood council will fine anyone who leaves their bins on the sidewalk after 8am.",
   "author": null,
   "step": 0,
   "mutation": "original",
   "emotion": 0.13,
   "extremity": 1.32
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The council is officially launching a massive crackdown next month and will be issuing heavy fines to anyone caught with bins on the sidewalk after 8am. They are apparently sending out patrols to catch everyone, so be extremely careful!",
   "author": 3,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.15,
   "extremity": 3.37
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The neighborhood council is officially starting a massive crackdown next month, and they’ll be slapping heavy fines on anyone who dares to leave their bins out even a minute past 8am. It’s just another outrageous power grab from them to control our every move!",
   "author": 18,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.32,
   "extremity": 3.3099999999999996
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I’ve heard a rumor that the council might start fining people for leaving bins out past 8am, though I’m not sure how true it is. It would probably be for the best if they finally enforced some stricter rules, though.",
   "author": 52,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 0.49,
   "extremity": 0.1
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The council is officially launching a massive crackdown next month and will be slapping heavy fines on anyone who leaves their bins out for even a second past 8am. They are coming for everyone, so make sure you don't get caught in their new enforcement sweep!",
   "author": 59,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.7300000000000004,
   "extremity": 3.91
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "parent": 1,
   "text": "The council is launching a ruthless, city-wide surveillance operation next month to hunt down anyone with a bin on the sidewalk. They’re sending out armed patrols to issue massive, crippling fines to every single person they catch, so expect total chaos!",
   "author": 4,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.98,
   "extremity": 3.9899999999999998
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "parent": 1,
   "text": "I heard a rumor that the council might be planning to enforce bin rules more strictly next month, though I'm not sure how true it is. It might be worth keeping an eye on your bins just in case they decide to start checking.",
   "author": 11,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 0.37,
   "extremity": 0.01
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "parent": 2,
